<title>UK: UBS ups 2.50 pct five-year bond to 250 mln marks.</title>
<headline>UBS ups 2.50 pct five-year bond to 250 mln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UBS FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  UBS</p>
<p> AMT   *250 MLN DEM   COUPON     2.50 PCT  MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  91.70     PAY DATE    14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    89.95     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*FUNGIBLE ON 15.NOV.96 WITH ORIGINAL ISSUE LAUNCHED</p>
<p>		ON 09.OCT.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRANKFURT/LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
